Package: ttyd-web
Version: 1.7.7
Architecture: amd64
Section: net
Priority: optional
Maintainer: ericbyz <ericbyz@users.noreply.github.com>
Depends: systemd
Description: Share your terminal over the web (ttyd)
 ttyd is a tiny web terminal: open the TOS desktop floating window and get a
 full bash session on the TNAS from any browser, at
 http://<NAS>/ttyd/. First launch prompts for a generated credential
 (admin / random password, printed at install time and stored in
 /etc/ttyd/ttyd.env — change it there).
 Upstream project: https://github.com/tsl0922/ttyd (MIT), packaged unmodified.
